<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠδάζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύδος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>revile, abuse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄμυκε, μὴ κύδαζέ μοι τὸν πρεσβύτερον
					ἀδελφεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					6
				</span></i>
			:—in 
				Med.
			, c.dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήνῳ κυδάζομαί τε κἀπ᾽ ὦν ἠχθόμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					35.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ τοι γυναιξὶ δεῖ κυδάζεσθαι:
				τί γάρ</span>; <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				94
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ πέπον ἦ μάλα δή με κακῷ
					ἐκυδάσσαο μύθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1337
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be reviled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				722
			</span></i>.</div>
